+        <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Photo of Sophika">
+      </div>
+      <p class="agent-note">Agent: Looks good to me. I wrote it, so I would say that.</p>
+    </header>
+
+    <section id="team" aria-labelledby="team-heading">
+      <div class="section-heading">
+        <p class="eyebrow">The people behind the commits</p>
+        <h2 id="team-heading">Meet the team</h2>
+        <p class="section-intro">Five M.Sc. students, each with their own perspective on building software.</p>
+        <p class="agent-note">Meet the humans. The agent asked to be listed as “lead developer”. Request denied.</p>
+      </div>
+      <div class="member-grid">
+        <article class="member-card">
+          <button class="card-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="log-annie" data-tooltip="Click to run git log" title="Click to run git log">
+            <img class="member-photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Photo of Annie">
+            <span class="member-name">Annie</span>
+            <span class="member-program">M.Sc. Computer Engineering · 5th semester</span>
+            <span class="member-line">Travelling and cooking; code review is the real engineering.</span>
+            <span class="hot-take">Hot take inside</span>
+          </button>
+          <div class="git-log" id="log-annie" hidden>
+            <h3>git log</h3>
+            <ul>
+              <li><span class="hash">a1b2c3d</span> Reviewed the code: correctness makes an engineer.</li>
