+              <li><span class="hash">c7d8e9f</span> Recorded a Dubai birth certificate in Arabic.</li>
+            </ul>
+          </div>
+        </article>
+
+        <article class="member-card">
+          <button class="card-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="log-avishkar" data-tooltip="Click to run git log" title="Click to run git log">
+            <img class="member-photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Photo of Avishkar">
+            <span class="member-name">Avishkar</span>
+            <span class="member-program">M.Sc. Computer Engineering · 3rd semester</span>
+            <span class="member-line">Systems thinker, investor, and 70s–80s guitar player.</span>
+            <span class="hot-take">Hot take inside</span>
