+          <div class="git-log" id="log-parastoo" hidden>
+            <h3>git log</h3>
+            <ul>
+              <li><span class="hash">c3d4e5f</span> Juggled 5+ tasks with a podcast at 1.5x speed.</li>
+              <li><span class="hash">a6b7c8d</span> Added distributed systems and real-world problem solving.</li>
